=== READ-OUT ===
  margin   = top1 - top2 logit at the final position (bigger = peakier)
  perturb  = max|one-shot - chunked| over the logit vector
  ratio    = perturb / margin; >1 means the argmax can flip

  If margin grows and ratio falls as context grows, the divergence is a
  property of the near-flat short-context regime (amplified by the
  reduced depth) and would be far rarer on the full 40-layer model.

